{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/5zCFEmV8Hr5TdNK1yWDhGQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:01.627829+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/5zCFEmV8Hr5TdNK1yWDhGQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>为方便有意愿申请天津大学硕士推免生的学生提前熟悉、了解我校推免流程环节，我校开通天津大学硕士研究生招生推免系统预报名。我校采取网上报名并提交电子材料方式接收申请，请符合申请条件的申请人（包括天津大学本校生）登录天津大学研究生招生信息网（yzb.tju.edu.cn）（服务系统-&gt;2027级推免硕士申请或https://sszs.tju.edu.cn/10056/user/login/login）填报信息。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>申请条件</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>拥护中国共产党的领导、愿为祖国建设服务、品德良好、遵纪守法的中国公民，且满足以下条件：</span></p><p><span>1.在目前就读学校有机会取得教育部推荐免试研究生资格的优秀应届本科毕业生（含天津大学本校生）；</span></p><p><span>2.研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力；</span></p><p><span>3.诚实守信，学风端正，不存在任何有违学术道德、专业伦理等行为；</span></p><p><span>4.身心健康，符合国家和我校规定的体检要求。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请流程</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>天津大学硕士研究生招生推免系统仅为天津大学接收硕士推免生的辅助系统，用于前期报名登记、信息采集。</span></p><p><span>1. 申请人在我校规定时间内，按要求填写本人各项真实信息，我院会根据申请时间分批收集、审核考生信息。</span></p><p><span>2. 初步录取结果请申请人查询我校研究生推免系统。申请人还需按照教育部、本科所在学校和省市招办要求在规定时间内登录教育部推荐免试服务系统，完成填报志愿、缴纳报名费、接受复试确认、接受待录取确认等环节，完成最终录取，具体网址和系统开放时间等内容后续将在天津大学研究生招生网（http://yzb.tju.edu.cn）另行通知。</span></p><p><span>3. 我院将根据报名情况收集信息，依据相关政策分批次开展考核选拔工作。我院接收推免生网上系统集中审核时间（请在学院集中审核之前申报）为8月24日、9月15日。</span></p><p><span>4. 考生相关纸质证明材料可扫描后上传系统（如系统遇到问题，请添加天大技术问题反馈QQ群，搜索群号“314310314”），如有其他疑问可联系报考学院。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>接收推免生专业</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>专业代码</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>专业名称</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>070300</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>化学</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>0703Z1</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>分子光电科学</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 申请人必须保证提交的申请信息及全部申请材料的真实性和准确性。对在推免过程中存在弄虚作假、有违学术道德和专业伦理等不当行为的，或存在其他严重影响推免过程和结果公平公正行为的，一经查实，取消我校免试读研资格。</span></p><p><span>2. 我校将在录取当年5-6月对所有拟录取的推免生进行资格复审。通过资格复审后，方可被正式录取，我校予以发放录取通知书。未通过资格复审者，取消其研究生录取资格。</span></p><p><span>3.本通知内容与教育主管部门下达文件不符的，以教育主管部门下达的文件为准。</span></p><p><span>4.咨询方式：</span></p><p><span>电话：022-27893326</span></p><p><span>邮箱：imas@tju.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>（暑期间优先邮箱方式联系）</span></p><p><span>5.相关网址：</span></p><p><span>学院官网：https://imas.tju.edu.cn/</span></p><p><span>天津大学研招网：https://yzb.tju.edu.cn/</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>图文排版：金璇</span></p><p><span>审核：朱文珺 李立强</span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>IMAS</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/6D7Z7Fse8J7E38G9yIstcmtSS35vjhM4XwoFlJ5ib1U8HZXiarU9NTc1OGQ5bdP1s8lMdYE6KdMqg0aNaiaSOy7EZe5G3okwVO7XK50fJ6YjuA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"d44dcdd30b7ffd9c9a0ed056d5cf61466d22567b954204f698286e9f121943e0","textLength":1193,"sourceSha256":"1a57aac440a55c217cf224584c15729fcddd4b758d7efefb138016dbc45ca4d0","selector"